4d3f7d8.mp4?t=1768937949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kulebra is a unique type of entity in this world, a Bright Soul. While you are counted among the dead, you are one of the few who have the unique ability to change the cycles many of the dead find themselves in. Through conversation, discovery, empathy, and some snooping around, you can mark the souls of the dead, helping them overcome what keeps them trapped, and eventually move on. You can help the Souls of Limbo create actual and lasting change.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABOUT THE DEVELOPER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2246470/extras/e44edcfd33f5a76675131ca412b2a7b0.avif?t=1768937949\" width=600 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Galla was founded by two Dominican brothers in Illinois, USA, in 2015, although we started long before moving to the USA. We decided to form this studio because we want to bring adventures and stories that spark enjoyment and leave a big impact on those who experience it, the same way past games shaped us.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our first project was a mobile endless runner with story elements. This game helped us gain a lot of development insight and confidence as developers. We didn\u2019t want to give up on the studio and our game, so we decided to give the characters and setting of that game a second life to transform them into something a lot closer to games we\u2019ve loved, leading to the creation of Kulebra and the Souls of Limbo.</p>","developers":["Galla"],"dlc":[3623210],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2246470/3653f046ef2c6181c3f1dbe1d32c4725212ec014/he